OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the team repairing a
OL,4,A5,000-year-old tomb
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt 1880ft it is hard to imagine a more
OL,7,Fscenic or challenging building site
OL,8,Fthan the summit of Slieve Gullion.
OL,10,FBut every day a team including
OL,11,Farchaeologists, engineers, stonemasons
OL,12,Fand blacksmiths has been trekking to
OL,13,Fthe top of County Armagh's highest
OL,14,Fmountain to repair its 5,000-year-old
OL,15,Fpassage tomb.
OL,17,FWednesday might mark the autumn equinox
OL,18,Fbut the structure comes into its own on
OL,19,Fthe winter solstice when light floods
OL,20,Fthe chamber at sunset.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
